1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Man: Check out these photos I took at the game last night.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,110
What do you think for a first attempt?

3
00:00:09,110 --> 00:00:11,280
Woman: Well, they're a little bit blurry.

4
00:00:11,280 --> 00:00:14,210
I'm not really sure what I'm looking at.

5
00:00:14,210 --> 00:00:20,200
Man: Oh, I suppose you're right. I really need to improve my photography skills.

6
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:23,200
Woman: Why don't you join the photography club?

7
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:26,230
We're happy to have members of all experience levels.

8
00:00:26,230 --> 00:00:29,030
Man: Have you found it helpful?

9
00:00:29,030 --> 00:00:31,290
Woman: You've seen the pictures from my vacation.
